# Two apps live side by side: poe1/ (this PoE1 port) and poe2/ (the PoE2
# port). Patterns below are written to match under either app folder.

# Xcode
**/*.xcodeproj/
**/*.xcworkspace/
xcuserdata/
DerivedData/
*.xcuserstate
.DS_Store

# uniffi output is regenerated by the Rust build phase
**/ios/PoB/Generated/

# Rust
target/

# Prototype decode output (poe2/crates/tree-assets, tree probe)
**/decoded/
**/decoded-icons/

# Upstream PoB: plain clones, re-fetched per league (scripts/fetch-pob.sh)
PathOfBuilding/
PathOfBuilding-PoE2/
**/design/shots/

# Xcode DerivedData (xcodebuild -derivedDataPath build), from repo root,
# an app folder, or its ios/
build/
**/ios/build/
tmp/
**/ios/tmp/

# Local scratch tests
**/tests/zz_scratch.rs
